    \nonumber &\qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad= \sum_{i=1}^{d_1}{\boldsymbol{\gamma}}_{1i}({\underline{h}})\brac{(z+h_{r+1})^i-z^i}-{\textbf{Q}}_1(h_{r+1}, {\underline{h}})\\
