        = \frac{(|({\underline{u}},1)|+(d_1-1))!}{(d_1-1)!} ({\boldsymbol{\beta}}_{1(|({\underline{u}},1)|+(d_1-1))}-{\boldsymbol{\beta}}_{w_{({\underline{u}},1)}(|({\underline{u}},1)|+(d_1-1))}).
