    By the induction hypothesis, if ${\boldsymbol{\beta}}_{1(|{\underline{u}}|+d_1)}-{\boldsymbol{\beta}}_{w_{{\underline{u}}}(|{\underline{u}}|+d_1)}$ is nonzero, then it is the leading coefficient of ${\textbf{P}}_1-{\textbf{P}}_{w_{{\underline{u}}}}$, and hence
